      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm looking at some estate docs for a client in the uk. they have some property in spain and some liquid assets in a shell company that weren't originally on the disclosure. what are the main tax implications for the beneficiaries if we find out about these assets late in the probate process?",
